---
// The wordmark: a speech bubble with a tick, then "Good" light and "Call" bold.
// The mark is drawn in the accent colour, so it follows light and dark mode.
// It is decoration; the name is read out as plain text.
---

<span class="wm">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true">
    <path
      class="wm-bubble"
      d="M18 10 H46 A10 10 0 0 1 56 20 V36 A10 10 0 0 1 46 46 H28 L18 55 V46 A10 10 0 0 1 8 36 V20 A10 10 0 0 1 18 10 Z"
    />
    <path class="wm-tick" d="M21 28.5 L28.5 36 L43 21" />
  </svg>
  <span><span class="wm-light">Good</span> <b>Call</b></span>
</span>
